        "title": "Walker Legs",
        "description": "4 pneumatic legs move the truck in all kinds of ways including spinning, climbing, and bracing in place. The truck is very slow, moving NEAR per TURN maximum. If this CHUNK is destroyed, all functions continue besides mobility.",
